==Description==
The '''GreenMist Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 2 of the premium [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{CandyCorns|50 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|34}} ({{Robux|25}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{CandyCorns|80 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|66}} ({{Robux|49}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale). 

The '''GreenMist Nametag''' has green gradient text and a black outline. It also a dark green mist behind it.

